							<div
								class="uagb-timeline__date-hide uagb-timeline__inner-date-new">October
								20, 2023</div>
							<h4 class="uagb-timeline__heading">Smarter Features</h4>
							<p class="uagb-timeline-desc-content">Launched automation,
								add-ons, and real-time tracking.</p>
							<div class="uagb-timeline__arrow"></div>
